    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOAL3</strong> is an arcade soccer game where there are no bans and rules! You will have to play fun and unpredictable matches on unique arenas, where nature itself will be the obstacle to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Tournament brings together the best national teams in the world - choose any of the 16 teams and fight for the Champions Cup. Or just play friendly matches - that's fun too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features several arenas with unique game mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STADION</strong> - Beware of lightning, it's electrifying and very dangerous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/909faeade08aec0543d53647097cd6b1.poster.avif?t=1755319027\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/909faeade08aec0543d53647097cd6b1.webm?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/909faeade08aec0543d53647097cd6b1.mp4?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WINTER PARK</strong> - The freezing rain will freeze your hottest attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/19659d72bd64486976feef11b875b48c.poster.avif?t=1755319027\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/19659d72bd64486976feef11b875b48c.webm?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/19659d72bd64486976feef11b875b48c.mp4?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEACH</strong> - Tornadoes are a hoot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/a59806ceb8aceb4c89c07ff4b85b74bb.poster.avif?t=1755319027\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/a59806ceb8aceb4c89c07ff4b85b74bb.webm?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/a59806ceb8aceb4c89c07ff4b85b74bb.mp4?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE FIELD</strong> - Geysers are sudden and powerful, just like your attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/b27f6d086116afd40683615cfa4e5a98.poster.avif?t=1755319027\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/b27f6d086116afd40683615cfa4e5a98.webm?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/b27f6d086116afd40683615cfa4e5a98.mp4?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOON</strong> - You better pass to your teammate, you don't want to get hit by a giant laser, do you?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/59aaee8d09cb10082d0218b93abfbda6.poster.avif?t=1755319027\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/59aaee8d09cb10082d0218b93abfbda6.webm?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/59aaee8d09cb10082d0218b93abfbda6.mp4?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAINING</strong> - Unsure of your skills? Try a workout regimen. I'm sure you'll quickly hone all the skills you need to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/ea09622ab58f42054e9ecd35800a2a77.poster.avif?t=1755319027\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/ea09622ab58f42054e9ecd35800a2a77.webm?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/ea09622ab58f42054e9ecd35800a2a77.mp4?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMANDS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Argentina</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Brazil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cameroon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Croatia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- England</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- France</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Germany</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Holland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Italy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Japan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mexico</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Portugal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Russia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Senegal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ukraine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Orcs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Elves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Astronauts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aliens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/c1b8ca436deecf92180aed4361770b2e.poster.avif?t=1755319027\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/c1b8ca436deecf92180aed4361770b2e.webm?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566920/extras/c1b8ca436deecf92180aed4361770b2e.mp4?t=1755319027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
